        "title": "\"I Have a Dream\" Speech by Dr. Martin Luther King, Jr. (August 28, 1963), National Recording Registry essay by Gregory Alan Barnes",
        "publisher": "Library of Congress",
        "retrievedAt": "2026-10-14",
